{
  "name": "Smoke test 5 min scope FFT",
  "description": "SMOKE TEST of the scope-FFT storage (2026-10-27): verifies that /sweeps/sweep_NNN/FFT is read from the scope's own FFT math display and stored on every sweep, alongside UL/AE/SP. No scope_fft key, so the FFT is left exactly as set on the front panel (Kim's setting). 1 min at rest, then 1800 rpm (breakaway above 600), 600, 3000 rpm, 1 min each, then rest. No temperature schedule: the Omron is not touched and the heater is not used. First run after UL/AE were moved out of the box onto the B&O linear supply.",
